Linus,

please pull ALSA HD-audio fixes for v2.6.31-rc5 from:

  git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/tiwai/sound-2.6.git fix/hda

This is the fixes only for HD-audio, thus a different (sub-)branch is
used.  It contains the following fixes.

Thanks!

Takashi

===

Chengu Wang (1):
      ALSA: hda: Correct EAPD for Dell Inspiron 1525

Roel Kluin (1):
      ALSA: hda - Read buffer overflow

Takashi Iwai (1):
      ALSA: hda - Fix quirk for Toshiba Satellite A135-S4527

Wu Fengguang (6):
      ALSA: hda: track CIRB/CORB command/response states for each codec
      ALSA: hda: take cmd_mutex in probe_codec()
      ALSA: hda: take reg_lock in azx_init_cmd_io/azx_free_cmd_io
      ALSA: hda: read CORBWP inside reg_lock
      ALSA: hda: remember last command for each codec
      ALSA: hda: warn on spurious response

